{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"729","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"D. Sea Battle"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"1 second"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Galya is playing one-dimensional Sea Battle on a "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 × n"},{"kind":"text","text":" grid. In this game "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"a"},{"kind":"text","text":" ships are placed on the grid. Each of the ships consists of "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"b"},{"kind":"text","text":" consecutive cells. No cell can be part of two ships, however, the ships "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"can touch"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" each other."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Galya doesn't know the ships location. She can shoot to some cells and after each shot she is told if that cell was a part of some ship (this case is called \"hit\") or not (this case is called \"miss\")."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Galya has already made "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"k"},{"kind":"text","text":" shots, all of them were misses."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Your task is to calculate the minimum number of cells such that if Galya shoot at all of them, she would hit at least one ship."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"It is guaranteed that there is at least one valid ships placement."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line contains four positive integers "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"a"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"b"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"k"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ n ≤ 2·105"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ a, b ≤ n"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"0 ≤ k ≤ n - 1"},{"kind":"text","text":") — the length of the grid, the number of ships on the grid, the length of each ship and the number of shots Galya has already made."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The second line contains a string of length "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":", consisting of zeros and ones. If the "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"i"},{"kind":"text","text":"-th character is one, Galya has already made a shot to this cell. Otherwise, she hasn't. It is guaranteed that there are exactly "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"k"},{"kind":"text","text":" ones in this string. "}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the first line print the minimum number of cells such that if Galya shoot at all of them, she would hit at least one ship."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the second line print the cells Galya should shoot at."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Each cell should be printed exactly once. You can print the cells in arbitrary order. The cells are numbered from "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1"},{"kind":"text","text":" to "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":", starting from the left."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"If there are multiple answers, you can print any of them."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"5 1 2 1\n00100\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"2\n4 2\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"13 3 2 3\n1000000010001\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"2\n7 11\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"There is one ship in the first sample. It can be either to the left or to the right from the shot Galya has already made (the \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"1"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" character). So, it is necessary to make two shots: one at the left part, and one at the right part."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"D","problemCode":"729D","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/729/problem/D"}